{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\Books\\6th\\Math\\JPG\\097.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Example 1:", "conf": 0.88, "box": [[209, 95], [397, 95], [397, 135], [209, 135]]}, {"text": "1. A set of months of the solar calendar.", "conf": 0.93, "box": [[206, 144], [890, 117], [892, 166], [208, 193]]}, {"text": "It is a set because:", "conf": 0.884, "box": [[281, 201], [565, 195], [566, 228], [282, 234]]}, {"text": "Quiek Check", "conf": 0.796, "box": [[1291, 282], [1493, 290], [1492, 327], [1290, 319]]}, {"text": "be in this set).", "conf": 0.848, "box": [[317, 301], [534, 298], [534, 334], [317, 337]]}, {"text": "All of its elements are distinct.", "conf": 0.896, "box": [[282, 352], [776, 338], [777, 380], [283, 394]]}, {"text": "Is the set of English", "conf": 0.942, "box": [[1284, 352], [1551, 367], [1549, 403], [1282, 388]]}, {"text": "2. The set of tasty food items.", "conf": 0.884, "box": [[198, 403], [724, 394], [725, 437], [199, 446]]}, {"text": "alphabets well- defined?", "conf": 0.911, "box": [[1285, 409], [1610, 428], [1608, 468], [1282, 449]]}, {"text": "It is not a set because:", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[274, 459], [620, 454], [621, 488], [275, 493]]}, {"text": "Its elements are not well-defined. Tasty food means something different to", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[281, 497], [1483, 469], [1484, 525], [283, 553]]}, {"text": "this set are not clear.", "conf": 0.872, "box": [[312, 614], [636, 609], [637, 645], [312, 650]]}, {"text": "3. A set of names of your teachers of Grade 6.", "conf": 0.94, "box": [[189, 662], [983, 645], [984, 696], [190, 714]]}, {"text": "It is a set because:", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[268, 720], [556, 718], [556, 751], [268, 754]]}, {"text": "Allof its elements are well-defined (there is no ambiguity about which names wilbe", "conf": 0.931, "box": [[266, 755], [1617, 743], [1618, 802], [267, 813]]}, {"text": "in this set).", "conf": 0.885, "box": [[303, 821], [477, 823], [477, 861], [303, 859]]}, {"text": "Note it down", "conf": 0.809, "box": [[1269, 832], [1487, 836], [1486, 870], [1269, 866]]}, {"text": ".All of its elements are distinct.", "conf": 0.911, "box": [[261, 875], [770, 871], [770, 907], [261, 911]]}, {"text": "Elements of a setmaybe", "conf": 0.901, "box": [[1267, 904], [1596, 910], [1595, 943], [1267, 936]]}, {"text": "4.The set of funny students in Grade 6.", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[185, 927], [876, 920], [876, 961], [186, 969]]}, {"text": "limited or unlimited.", "conf": 0.886, "box": [[1265, 961], [1541, 964], [1540, 996], [1265, 994]]}, {"text": "It is not a set because:", "conf": 0.869, "box": [[259, 983], [611, 980], [612, 1012], [259, 1015]]}, {"text": ".Its elements are not well-defined. Funniness means something different to everyone.", "conf": 0.934, "box": [[260, 1030], [1612, 1019], [1612, 1061], [261, 1072]]}, {"text": ". A person may be funny to one and not funny to others. So, this is not a set.", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[254, 1084], [1481, 1075], [1482, 1118], [255, 1127]]}, {"text": "A set is denoted by a capital letter such as A, B, J, K, M, N, etc.", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[180, 1140], [1141, 1133], [1142, 1172], [181, 1180]]}, {"text": "Example 2:", "conf": 0.885, "box": [[179, 1194], [368, 1191], [368, 1232], [180, 1234]]}, {"text": "1. A set of 3 birds", "conf": 0.848, "box": [[179, 1246], [518, 1244], [518, 1280], [180, 1282]]}, {"text": "Let's denote this set by the capital letter B.", "conf": 0.899, "box": [[175, 1298], [839, 1296], [839, 1335], [175, 1337]]}, {"text": "So, B= (parrot, sparrow, crow)", "conf": 0.905, "box": [[178, 1353], [649, 1353], [649, 1391], [178, 1391]]}, {"text": "2.A set of the first 3 capital letters having only curved lines.", "conf": 0.891, "box": [[177, 1402], [1214, 1404], [1214, 1443], [177, 1441]]}, {"text": "Let's denote this set by the capital letter K.", "conf": 0.911, "box": [[176, 1457], [839, 1458], [839, 1495], [176, 1494]]}, {"text": "So, K= (C, O, S)", "conf": 0.878, "box": [[184, 1511], [426, 1511], [426, 1548], [184, 1548]]}, {"text": "3.The set of odd numbers.", "conf": 0.853, "box": [[174, 1562], [663, 1564], [662, 1601], [173, 1598]]}, {"text": "Let's denote this set by the capital letter O", "conf": 0.877, "box": [[172, 1614], [841, 1618], [841, 1657], [171, 1653]]}, {"text": "O= [1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 11, 13, ..]", "conf": 0.857, "box": [[173, 1670], [583, 1670], [583, 1709], [173, 1709]]}, {"text": "known as ellipsis.", "conf": 0.896, "box": [[172, 1829], [444, 1829], [444, 1869], [172, 1869]]}, {"text": "them to give the reason for their answer.", "conf": 0.944, "box": [[312, 1941], [861, 1950], [861, 1987], [312, 1978]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSAUE", "conf": 0.838, "box": [[268, 2066], [559, 2064], [559, 2101], [268, 2103]]}, {"text": "95", "conf": 0.665, "box": [[865, 2074], [918, 2074], [918, 2113], [865, 2113]]}]}